A||N||33||Jay||Toronto Fiero Show, Who's going?||||1||
Z||000000||Jay||07-25-2001||02:39 PM||||Well the 4th annual GTA Fiero Club's show is set for September 15, 2001 at the Bramalea city center just north of Toronto.  Last year there were about 100 cars and as always there will be lots of classes and expensive give-aways, so almost everyone will go away with something.  We expect to see quite a few from New York and Michigan and rumor has it that there will be a few Northstar's there (including my own) some turbos, 3.8 SC and of course kit cars.  For more info go here <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/gtaclub/" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/gtaclub/</A> <P>So who's going?  <P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||CanadianGT||07-25-2001||03:26 PM||||Iwil be there without a doubt!!  I went last year and it was amazing!  I want a ride in a v8 soooooooo   badly!!!  Hopefully somone there will take me!<BR>PeAcE<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000002||Old Lar||07-25-2001||06:46 PM||||I was there last year with my 87 and got a trophy...  Fran got Best of Show.  A nice day trip for me..I'll follow Fran up again.  Keep this up to the top.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||07-26-2001||01:05 AM||||I was there last year as well... I'll try to go this year, but no promises.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
