Z||000005||banditbalz||07-26-2001||01:28 AM||||Assuming Becky and I are back from our honeymoon, we plan on being there. The GTA club actually changed the show date on account a large portion of the participants will be at our wedding.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bannerfieroBeck_17.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||6
