Z||000023||grinthock||07-29-2001||09:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Santa Cruzer:<BR>[B]why do you guys even give a sh!t about who hands out busness card and where?<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Santa, honestly?  If Race-Tech is sponsoring the show, another comapany can NOT just come in and start promoting themselves, that's not fair to the major sponsor.  But if someone ASKS For it from a CUSTOMER of that shop, that's different.  Agree?<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR> who cares it's a car show in a damn parking lot of god sakes!,slammed why are you bringing comment's about grinthock in here? your adding to the problem<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I agree, those comments here are not appropriate to the situtation, now if it was a conversation about how I have a bad temper occasionally then yeah those would be cool.<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR> personally i think grinthock is a cool guy,and should not be banned from a club or show for that matter..<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks dude, honestly I do'nt think ANYONE should be banned from a show/club that is NON profit unless they have done stuff wrong that is CLUB related<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>btw slammed are you comming in here protesting to everyone that you come from a  wealhy family?,i think what your trying to do is bragg about yourself!, enough said i will no longer read or reply anything in this thread.. goodbye!<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>JM don't respond to that here dude, let's stay on topic.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000024||Slammed Fiero||07-29-2001||10:20 PM||||I just wanted to say my piece. Over the last few months I have been threatened, My past and present Girlfriends have been treated rudely , I have been attacked because of my family's success. A simple apology would have suficed.<P>As for you Santa Cruzer or fierodude or whatever...I never talk about wealth or money on the forum. I'm personally poor , my family may be successful , I have never put down people because of money , or my parents financial standing. Does anyone even know what my parents do ?? Probably not. A close Fiero friend whom I have talked to for years thought my dad worked at GM til about 2 months ago..<P><BR>As for the Show , I hope to be there , My NOS install is complete , But I'm very busy with school at the moment.<P>JM ||||reg||1
